// The C runtime with external linkage, which is what the LLVM target
// links against: it compiles the runtime as its own translation unit
// rather than splicing it into the program. Source of truth: this file,
// kept in step with prelude.id by hand (idc.py's RUNTIME, which used to
// generate both, is frozen -- see docs/HACKING.md).

